WEBVTT

00:08:57.366 --> 00:09:00.035
I looked down at the baby onesie
that I was folding,

00:09:00.077 --> 00:09:02.454
and I thought to myself,

00:09:02.496 --> 00:09:03.872
"Why am I folding this?"

00:09:03.872 --> 00:09:08.460
(Laughter)

00:09:08.502 --> 00:09:10.629
Baby onesies don't really wrinkle.

00:09:10.629 --> 00:09:11.964
(Laughter)

00:09:11.964 --> 00:09:15.259
And even if they did, nobody cares
if a baby's in a wrinkly onesie.

00:09:15.301 --> 00:09:16.427
(Laughter)

00:09:16.427 --> 00:09:18.637
Furthermore, I was probably
going to change her

00:09:18.679 --> 00:09:20.347
four times before lunch.

00:09:20.389 --> 00:09:21.515
(Laughter)

00:09:22.391 --> 00:09:24.560
This doesn't need to be folded.

00:09:25.311 --> 00:09:26.478
I said it out loud

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:28.939
and literally braced myself

00:09:28.939 --> 00:09:32.484
for the laundry police?